mapping "V3843.1" source="V3843" target="214435005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V3843 is a Swedish 6-character extension of ICD-10 V38.4 (boarding/alighting,
        noncollision 3-wheel) + annan sysselsättning. The Swedish 6th character encodes the activity
        context of the injured party (sport/leisure/work/vital activity/etc.) — a contextual dimension
        with no SNOMED CT analogue. The base ICD-10 code (V38.4/5/6/7) has a verified Athena SNOMED
        214435005 36198007 crosswalk to SNOMED CT 443050 (Noncollision motor vehicle traffic accident while
        boarding or alighting) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). The Swedish
        extension inherits that crosswalk; the activity-context dimension is dropped. Both targets are
        broader than the source (the source is a more specific, activity-tagged variant). : verified
        Athena crosswalk on the parent, one dropped dimension (activity context).
        """
}
